<title>INDIA: India 96/97 steel output rises to 14.21 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 steel output rises to 14.21 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 14.21 million tonnes of saleable steel in 1996/97 (April-March) compared with 13.98 million in the previous year, the government said in its monthly economic statement on Saturday.</p>
</text>
